title start
kind: note
tags: business-plan strategy success-metrics-definition
Strategy success metrics definition
title end

paragraph start
This page defines success in numbers. It names the metrics only. The analytics area measures them.
paragraph end

paragraph start
One metric for each of reach, attention, action, money and effort. A number that does not lead to one of these is not a goal.
paragraph end

code start
language: text
reach       audience growth per account
attention   watch time and retention
action      link clicks
money       income per stream
effort      hours worked per week
code end

